58
00:06:53.550 --> 00:06:59.710
<v Speaker 1>Like when you win a competition or generally when there is some kind of prize involved, the word fawz is used.

59
00:07:00.150 --> 00:07:14.110
<v Speaker 1>wa man yuta Allah wa rasoolahu yudhkhilal jannatin tajarimin pahtihal anharu khalidina fiha wazalikal fawzul azeen Whoever obeys Allah and His Messenger is going to enter paradise that has rivers flowing under it.

60
00:07:14.670 --> 00:07:16.350
