<v Speaker 1>He gets a harvest.

75
00:08:29.030 --> 00:08:34.270
<v Speaker 1>which is many times more, exponentially more than his original investment.

76
00:08:34.590 --> 00:08:35.790
<v Speaker 1>That is Falah.

77
00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:40.430
<v Speaker 1>That's the concept of Falah.

78
00:08:40.430 --> 00:08:42.030
<v Speaker 1>That is success.

79
00:08:42.190 --> 00:08:47.470
<v Speaker 1>To receive a return on your investment that is beyond measure.

80
